# The default apps a standard bande-desktop install gets: the Bande apps built in
# bande-linux/apps and released on their own. bande-desktop recommends them unversioned, so a
# user can remove or replace any of them. Packages built in the desktop repo are part of the
# desktop and are not listed here. One package per line.
# Read by debian/default-apps.sh, ci/release/build-all.sh and ci/deb/install-test/run.sh.

bande-terminal
bande-software
bande-installer
bande-monitor
bande-calculator
